CoMemBench — Dataset License
============================

The annotations, workflow structures, node contexts, and instance index files
in this repository ("CoMemBench v1") are released under the
Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0).

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

You are free to share and adapt the material for any purpose, even commercially,
provided that you give appropriate credit, provide a link to the license, and
indicate if changes were made.

Upstream sources retain their own terms. Problems are constructed from the
following corpora; if you use the corresponding domains, please also cite and
respect the upstream license:

  stateful_tool_use                    Toolathlon
  repository_code_change               SWE-bench Verified
  offline_information_retrieval        BrowseComp+
  mathematical_and_structured_reasoning  Lean4 proof-dependent workflows

Evaluation oracles, gold trajectories, and pollution plans are NOT part of this
release and are not covered by this license grant.
